      "content": "For high-traffic commercial lobbies, polished concrete offers excellent durability and low maintenance, though it can show scuffs if unprotected. Natural stone provides a high-end aesthetic but requires regular sealing and is more susceptible to scratching and etching than concrete. Luxury Vinyl Tile (LVT) is generally very scratch and scuff resistant and requires minimal maintenance, making it a practical choice for heavy foot traffic.",
