    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. can u go into a bit more detail on the stone vs concrete? like, if we go with stone, what's the actual upkeep like on a weekly/monthly basis? and specifically with the scratching, are we talking about surface level things or deep gouges from heavy movement?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
